WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.208 --> 00:00:03.541
- Hey, new kid, your fancy clothes may play well in a big city like Carolina,

00:00:03.750 --> 00:00:05.500
but here in New England, we dress like s--t.

00:00:05.666 --> 00:00:06.250
- Ignore him.

00:00:06.333 --> 00:00:06.708
- Dude.

00:00:06.791 --> 00:00:07.250
- Pretends.

00:00:07.375 --> 00:00:07.833
- He has.

00:00:07.916 --> 00:00:09.208
- A long-distance friend. 

00:00:09.458 --> 00:00:11.166
- Tom is real. He lives in Tampa!

00:00:11.333 --> 00:00:13.000
- Shine through the shade, baby. I just dance. 

00:00:13.333 --> 00:00:16.166
- [Boston sports radio:] If Cam dances, he should be covered in chowdah 
and thrown in the harbor. 

00:00:16.541 --> 00:00:17.041
- Man, what?

00:00:17.291 --> 00:00:18.500
- Haven’t you listened to the radio? 

00:00:18.666 --> 00:00:20.458
New England has banned dancing!

00:00:21.375 --> 00:00:23.708
- So The Patriot Way is when we play a game but hate playing it?

00:00:23.875 --> 00:00:26.833
- Well, Gronk was allowed to be fun because he was whiiiiiii—y we were winning.

00:00:26.916 --> 00:00:28.916
- Man, other transfer students don’t have to deal with this!

00:00:32.791 --> 00:00:33.416
- Awwwwwwww...

00:00:33.583 --> 00:00:35.083
- Stay away from my team, Foles.

00:00:36.083 --> 00:00:37.875
- All right, I'll be here when you need me!

00:00:38.416 --> 00:00:39.833
- YOU’LL NEVER BE MY REAL DAD.

00:00:40.083 --> 00:00:42.583
- BUT I’LL BE BEST MOTHERFLUFFIN STEPDAD YOU EVER HAD.

00:00:43.250 --> 00:00:44.291
- I know what we need: 

00:00:44.791 --> 00:00:46.416
a black-and-white training Instagram.

00:00:46.708 --> 00:00:49.291
- ♪♪♪ Now we Pats fans finally see ♪♪♪

00:00:49.375 --> 00:00:52.208
♪♪♪ Brady was a system QB ♪♪♪

00:00:52.416 --> 00:00:54.708
♪♪♪ New Patriots way ♪♪♪

00:00:55.166 --> 00:00:57.375
♪♪♪ or the highway! ♪♪♪

00:00:57.666 --> 00:00:59.875
- [Boston sports radio:] This is good. This gives Stidham more time to develop.

00:01:02.583 --> 00:01:05.291
- Ok and one more thing, I'm sick of these New York comedy writers 

00:01:05.333 --> 00:01:07.416
and their internet cartoons that make fun of my people. 

00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:08.916
Why would I subscribe to this garbage 

00:01:08.958 --> 00:01:12.958
when I got Boston sports radio playing 24/7 and the Kelly's Roast Beef on Route 1. 

00:01:13.125 --> 00:01:15.125
And another thing, when it gets cold in Foxboro, 

00:01:15.208 --> 00:01:18.416
the PSI of a football goes down. Talk to a professor at MIT.

